.TH "YAMLR-MIGRATE" "1" "November 2026" "Yamlr Manual" "User Commands"
\fBStandalone Kubernetes API Migration Engine\fR
.PP
The \fBmigrate\fR command performs safe, surgical modernization of deprecated and retired Kubernetes API versions (such as \fBextensions/v1beta1\fR, \fBnetworking.k8s.io/v1beta1\fR, \fBpolicy/v1beta1\fR, \fBautoscaling/v2beta1\fR, \fBbatch/v1beta1\fR) across single files or large repository directory trees.
.PP
Unlike full healing, \fBmigrate\fR enforces a strict \fBzero-side-effect mandate\fR: it \fIonly\fR upgrades deprecated API versions and required companion schema shifts (such as Ingress \fBpathType: Prefix\fR and Deployment \fBspec.selector.matchLabels\fR synthesis), strictly refusing to inject unrequested resource limits, probes, or security contexts.
.PP
---
.PP
.SH "USAGE"
.nf
.RS
# Preview proposed API migrations in colored unified diff (default safe preview)
yamlr migrate ./k8s --to 1.30 --diff

# Apply migrations in-place across manifests
yamlr migrate ./k8s --to 1.30 --apply

# Apply migrations in CI without generating .bak backup files
yamlr migrate ./k8s --to 1.30 --apply --no-backup

# Process multi-document streams and preserve document boundaries (---)
yamlr migrate ./manifests/bundle.yaml --to 1.32 --diff
.RE
.fi
---
.PP
.SH "OPTIONS"
| Flag | Short | Description |
.PP
|:---|:---:|:---|
.PP
| \fB[PATH]\fR | | Manifest file or directory tree to migrate (defaults to \fB.\fR). |
.PP
| \fB--to <VERSION>\fR | | Target Kubernetes version for modern APIs (e.g. \fB1.30\fR, \fB1.35\fR). |
.PP
| \fB--k8s-version <V>\fR | | Alias for \fB--to\fR. |
.PP
| \fB--apply\fR | \fB-a\fR | Apply migrations in-place to disk with pre-write safety verification. |
.PP
| \fB--diff\fR | \fB-d\fR | Display colored unified diff showing exact proposed line changes. |
.PP
| \fB--dry-run\fR | | Preview proposed migrations without writing to disk (default). |
.PP
| \fB--no-backup\fR | | Disable creation of \fB.bak\fR safety backup files (recommended in CI/CD). |
.PP
| \fB--quiet\fR | \fB-q\fR | Suppress banners and progress; print only migrated file records. |
.PP
---
.PP
.SH "SUPPORTED API MIGRATIONS"
